{
  "id": "hex-mosaic",
  "name": "Hexagon Mosaic",
  "url": "shaders/hex-mosaic.wgsl",
  "description": "Hexagonal glass-tile mosaic that reveals the clear image around the mouse cursor. Beveled tiles with grout seams shimmer with audio-reactive glints, bass boosts saturation, clicks send light ripples across the tiles, and holding the mouse down magnifies the mosaic under the cursor.",
